language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

state MachineState.
state TargetHistoryState.
state SimulatorTruthState.
state StemProfileState.
state PlannerState.
state AptDraftState.
state EconomicContextState.
state ProductionState.
state OperatorContextState.
state SimulatorContextState.
state PresentationState.
state CommandObservationState.
state StopState.

MachineService tracks MachineState.
MachineState typed-as StateRecord.
MachineState initially "Unavailable until target handshake, recovery choice and evidence-backed calibration/semantic baseline.".
P1000Gateway tracks TargetHistoryState.
TargetHistoryState typed-as StateRecord.
TargetHistoryState initially "Explicit configured empty/buffered history at session start; source range/gap state must be advertised.".
P1000Simulator tracks SimulatorTruthState.
SimulatorTruthState typed-as StateRecord.
SimulatorTruthState initially "Configured seed/scenario initialization; fixture details are not guessed.".
StemProfile tracks StemProfileState.
StemProfileState typed-as SeriesValue.
StemProfileState initially "No valid profile until sufficient coherent samples/model gates; preserve absolute and working coordinates.".
PlanningCoordinator tracks PlannerState.
PlannerState typed-as StateRecord.
PlannerState initially "No plan until valid inputs; later pending work retains prior valid plan and its own currentness metadata.".
AptDomain tracks AptDraftState.
AptDraftState typed-as StateRecord.
AptDraftState initially "No draft selected; import/load/edit/save/activation are distinct lifecycle transitions.".
EconomicPolicy tracks EconomicContextState.
EconomicContextState typed-as StateRecord.
EconomicContextState initially "Explicit unconfigured economics is distinct from a fabricated zero-valued settlement contract.".
ProductionAuthority tracks ProductionState.
ProductionState typed-as ProductionRecordValue.
ProductionState initially "Authoritative persisted baseline/recovery policy required; see production persistence gap.".
OperatorUiDomain tracks OperatorContextState.
OperatorContextState typed-as StateRecord.
OperatorContextState initially "Machine and Bucking availability tracked independently; unknown is not zero.".
SimulatorUiDomain tracks SimulatorContextState.
SimulatorContextState typed-as StateRecord.
SimulatorContextState initially "Disconnected simulator-only projection; no hidden truth in operator context.".
PresentationManager tracks PresentationState.
PresentationState typed-as SchemaValue.
PresentationState initially "No schema until validated bootstrap; candidate, published and rendered revisions remain distinct.".
UiCommandCoordinator tracks CommandObservationState.
CommandObservationState typed-as StateRecord.
CommandObservationState initially "No pending commands; later unknown outcome remains distinct from cancelled/expired/conflict.".
MachineService tracks StopState.
StopState typed-as StopOccurrenceValue.
StopState initially "Session-scoped dedupe horizon and generation initialized by authoritative service contract.".
